# Data files

This directory holds astronomy data files:

- `de421.bsp` — JPL planetary ephemeris (Sun, Moon, planets)
- `hip_main.dat` — Hipparcos star catalog (~118,000 stars)
- `constellationship.fab` — Stellarium constellation line data

These files are symlinked or copied from the existing astronomy data.
If missing, Skyfield will download them automatically on first run.
